Apply this domain algorithm to prepared evidence: Choose from approved read-only or bounded diagnostic operations, considering expected discrimination and operational risk. Validate scope and rate limits, request commander approval for intrusive checks, and record what each possible result would change.
For each field, return a value only when supported, source IDs, authority, one rejected alternative, and status established, disputed, unknown, or inapplicable. Preserve contrary evidence and distinguish observation from inference.
